    - rid: 7146566189421428918
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: UnityEditor.GraphToolkitModule}
      data:
        m_Value: 'Pirate base: a pirate boss calls the players to his base, 20 km out (out of sight), and gives them a waypoint;

          its pirates are neutral. Arriving there, each player is asked what brings them: a wrong answer turns every pirate

          in the orbit on that player and their squad.

          Settings: base (a station). The base''s spot is in the Spawn, Set Waypoint and On nodes.'
